18-08-24-03.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:24:14Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Luther", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:24:17Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Martin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:24:19Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Martin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:24:21Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Not king", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:24:31Z", "username": "Srikanth Kapali", "text": "Martin luther", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:24:41Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Martin Luther is correct!", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:25:06Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Vats: 55, Srikanth: 10, Srijan: 10, KP: 15, Akshay: 20", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:25:16Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Iska first day of trial kal tha na?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:25:26Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Yesterday's prep 😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:25:49Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "So today would be the second day of the trial", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]